codex
Another accepted premise is wrong: UART service accesses call its interrupt-update routine immediately, so F22’s claim that deassertion waits for a later scheduled tick does not hold. The proposed EOI rows also need IRR and ISR set at the same time; a poll immediately followed by EOI leaves the IRR-clearing defect untested.


