GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/i8259eoiirr/pass1_20261025/codex_t19p1.txt-10-- V3 belongs to **Algor**, not Iyonix. `machine_algor.c`, `MACHINE_SETUP(algor)`, creates it; Iyonix uses the generic ISA bus through i80321. V3’s handlers are not verbatim copies: they split local/ISA outputs and support dummy callback line 16.
