GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/i8259eoiirr/pass1_20261025/codex_t19p1.txt-127-**DERIVED:** With A, a normal PIT guest has **no implemented device-completion path that clears master IRR0**. Masking suppresses delivery but preserves the request. EOI no longer clears it. Under B, completing service likewise exposes that same retained request again.
