GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/i8259eoiirr/pass1_20261025/grok_t19p1.txt:86:A fourth hole: reinstating only the non-specific statement `d->irr &= ~d->isr` also leaves all 19 rows green. With `isr == 0` that statement is a no-op, and `nonspec irr4` already expects `0x01` on current HEAD. The red rows are only the specific arm.
